flowchart LR
  Actor[Authenticated role] --> Dashboard[Role-scoped dashboard RPC]
  Dashboard --> Aggregates[(Approved aggregate records)]
  Admin[System Admin] --> Readiness[Readiness RPC]
  Readiness --> Runtime[(Runtime and cutover state)]
  Officer[Authorized PARAYA] --> Report[Report lifecycle RPC]
  Aggregates --> Narrative[Strict reporting aggregate DTO]
  Narrative --> AI[Advisory narrative provider]
  AI --> Report
  Report --> ReportEvents[(Immutable report events)]
  Notification[In-app notification] --> Outbox[(Email/SMS outbox)]
  Admin --> Delivery[Provider runtime and explicit requeue]
  Delivery --> Outbox
  Worker[Authenticated delivery worker] --> Outbox
  Worker --> Provider[Configured email/SMS provider]
  Worker --> DeliveryEvents[(Immutable delivery events)]
